        "title": "Literary Translation: Fidelity and Freedom",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "FIDELITY TO WHAT?\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  A. The words (lexical faithfulness)                        │\n  │  B. The structure (syntactic faithfulness)                  │\n  │  C. The meaning (semantic faithfulness)                     │\n  │  D. The style, register, tone (aesthetic faithfulness)      │\n  │  E. The effect on the reader (dynamic faithfulness)         │\n  │  F. The cultural world (cultural faithfulness)              │\n  │                                                             │\n  │  Maximizing any one often sacrifices the others.            │\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-LITERARY-TRANSLATION.md#004",
      "path": [
        "04-LITERARY-TRANSLATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
